  "caveats": [
    "Maintainer UI labels the coordinate compress/s2 with custom ecosystem klauspost; prose identifies Go github.com/klauspost/compress/s2, while Reviewed correctly uses the containing module github.com/klauspost/compress. Preserve all raw identities rather than importing the UI vendor label as a Go ecosystem.",
    "Maintainer <=v1.18.6 and patched v1.18.7 correspond to the explicit release claims; Reviewed uses <1.18.7 without the v prefix. High/CVSS 3.1 7.5 agree. Trigger requires attacker-supplied dictionary data reaching NewDict and subsequent encoding.",
    "Fixed database source and developer advisory were individually compared. Database and maintainer dates remain separately attributed.",
    "Exploitation and CISA KEV are unverified; unknown is not evidence of absence.",
    "Public HTML was reviewed after an API rate-limit failure; exact maintainer modification/withdrawal timestamps were not exposed."
  ],
